ith/without agent) match the page content.\n\n## Conclusion\nThe task required finding explanations and examples of the passive voice in the Grammar section of the Cambridge Dictionary website. The screenshots clearly show the \"Passive voice\" grammar article was located, containing both explanations and multiple examples, all matching the response.\n\n**Verdict: SUCCESS**",
